      "description": "This  DJI  Phantom drone has a Go Pro camera mounted underneath and can go anywhere.  The pilot was practicing flying in the high wind.  I asked him to get the moon in perspective and he could put it wherever I asked.  You can buy one yourself off the Internet.   Amazing machine, but some concerns with that camera too.",
